<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννεοσσεύω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννενη-ττεύω</span></b> , later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννοσσεύω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			LXX
			<u>Je.</u>
			22.23
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Gp.</u>
			5.48.1
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make a nest
				in</i> a place, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1108
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				949c
			</span></i>; as etym. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.Lond.
				3.22
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c.acc.,
				<i>hatch as in a nest,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1.135e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδείας ψυχαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					24.307d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be hatched,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμίαι ἐννενεοττευμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					573e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
